> 0, 1) // Tag non-respondents to the political preferences question

. 
.         
.         * Exclusion rules to be implemented at the analysis stage for H3
.         tempvar dup

.         duplicates tag hid, generate(`dup') // Tag duplicated hids 

Duplicates in terms of hid

.         gen h3_tag = cond(`dup' == 1 & inlist(partner, 1, 2, 3) & inlist(sex,
>  1, 2), 0, 1) // Tag HIDs with number of people != 2 and/or HIDs with uncerta
> inty wrt the partnership status + non-respondents to the sex question

.         tempvar sex_partner1 sex_partner2

.         bysort hid: egen `sex_partner1' = max(sex)

.         bysort hid: egen `sex_partner2' = min(sex)              

.         forvalues i = 1/2{
  2.                 replace `sex_partner`i'' = . if h3_tag == 1 // Remove alre
> ady tagged obs from sex_partner vars
  3.         }
(510 real changes made, 510 to missing)
(510 real changes made, 510 to missing)

.         replace h3_tag = 1 if `sex_partner1' == `sex_partner2' // Tag same-se
> x couples
(0 real changes made)

