> ivities at the household level        

.         gen `share_gender_typical_activities' = (`h_gender_typical_activities
> ' / `h_gender_typical_activities_hh') // Share of women-specific stereotypica
> l activities in the household
(221 missing values generated)

.         replace `share_gender_typical_activities' = 0.5 if `share_gender_typi
